msgstr "Draft not found."

msgid "plugins.generic.abstractAssistant.intro"
msgstr "The assistant drafts a translation of the title, abstract and keywords — or language-edits the existing version — which the editor reviews, edits and approves field by field. A good English abstract is a practical requirement for Scopus and Web of Science."

